// Points Prism at Soma cloud. Committed, written by the export.
//
// Both values are public by design: row level security is what protects the
// data. To use your own Supabase project, replace them here or set them in
// Supabase.xcconfig (git ignored), which is read after this file. With an empty
// key the app runs with no account, everything on the phone.
// "//" starts a comment in an xcconfig, so the address is written with an
// empty $() between the slashes; Xcode joins it back to https://...
SOMA_SUPABASE_URL = https:/$()/qnysyehawitnlcnccyop.supabase.co
SOMA_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY =
